{
  "key": 44018,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_IGotAPalPadDownstairs",
      "en_US": [
        "Yay! I got a Pal Pad at the\n",
        "Pokémon Wi-Fi Club downstairs!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SwitchOnThePC",
      "en_US": [
        "Switch on the PC at any Pokémon\n",
        "Center.\r",
        "Connect to “Someone’s PC” and access\n",
        "the Pokémon Storage System.\r",
        "That’s all you need to do to store\n",
        "or bring out your Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_TellMeFavoriteKindOfTrainer",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmmm...!\r",
        "What is your favorite kind of Trainer?\n",
        "Can you tell me?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_BeWhichKindOfTrainer",
      "en_US": [
        "Which kind of Trainer would you like\n",
        "to be?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_IsThisWhatYouWantToBe",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 14, 0, 0} is the kind of Trainer\n",
        "you want to be?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SoThisIsWhatYouLike",
      "en_US": [
        "I see! So {STRVAR_1 14, 0, 0} is the kind\n",
        "of Trainer you like.\r",
        "If that’s the case, others may come\n",
        "to see you in the same way.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_IllJustTalkToYouLater",
      "en_US": "OK, then I’ll just talk to you later!"
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_WhatKindOfTrainerDoYouLike",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello! You’ve been mistaken for\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 14, 0, 0}, haven’t you?\r",
        "But I think you can also pass for\n",
        "a different kind of Trainer.\r",
        "So, how about telling me what kind of\n",
        "Trainer that you like?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_TeamGalacticIsAMystery",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmmm!\n",
        "What, or who, is this Team Galactic?!\r",
        "They make wonderful claims of a dream\n",
        "energy source on one hand...\r",
        "But rumor has it, they steal Pokémon\n",
        "from others by force.\r",
        "It’s a mystery! They’re mysterious!\n",
        "Isn’t anyone investigating them?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_WhatOrWhoIsTeamGalactic",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmmm!\n",
        "What, or who, is this Team Galactic?!\r",
        "Lately, they’ve renounced such acts\n",
        "as stealing Pokémon.\r",
        "They’re still involved in developing \n",
        "dream energies, but ethically now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_CaptureBattleVideoUsingVsRecorder",
      "en_US": [
        "You know how you can battle a friend\n",
        "using wireless communications?\r",
        "Well now, you can capture it as a Battle\n",
        "Video using a Vs. Recorder!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_CoolYouHaveAVsRecorder",
      "en_US": [
        "Cool!\n",
        "You have a Vs. Recorder!\r",
        "So, did you go to the Global Terminal in\n",
        "Jubilife City? Did ya? Did ya?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_GraceIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, I’m Grace, the Idol! I’m just back\n",
        "from a show in Oreburgh Mine!\r",
        "So, shall we battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_GraceBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll let you join my fan club if you can\n",
        "beat me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_GraceBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "You won’t accept my challenge?!\n",
        "But I’m an Idol..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_GracePostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, that’s me and my Pokémon!\n",
        "I hope you’ll support us!\r",
        "Just so you know, our latest single is\n",
        "titled “Jigglin’ Pokémon Wub”!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello there, young Trainer!\r",
        "I’m with Jubilife TV.\n",
        "The Fun-and-Games TV Station!\r",
        "We’re running a special promotion all\n",
        "over the Sinnoh region right now.\r",
        "We’re challenging Trainers to take\n",
        "a short quiz of five questions.\r",
        "There’s a great reward if you win!\n",
        "Do you want to have a go?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerDeclined",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back if you change your mind.\n",
        "We’ll be waiting for more challengers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerRollCamera",
      "en_US": [
        "Fantastic!\n",
        "Roll camera!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWrong",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sorry...\n",
        "That was the wrong answer.\r",
        "But you’re welcome to try again\n",
        "to score the big prize."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "We have a winner!\n",
        "Congratulations, Trainer!\r",
        "The grand prize is these three lovely\n",
        "Pokémon that I battled you with!\r",
        "The rare Pokémon from Hoenn...\n",
        "Treecko, Torchic, and Mudkip!\r",
        "Please speak to me when you’re able\n",
        "to collect your prize."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerPrizeIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Here they are!\n",
        "The prizes for our winner!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerBye",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for playing.\n",
        "Look out for our colleagues!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerCameraman",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, I’m just a cameraman.\n",
        "Don’t mind me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerLetsFind",
      "en_US": "Let’s find out if you’re correct!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerAnswerYes",
      "en_US": [
        "Yes?\n",
        "Yes Town?\r",
        "I’ve never heard of a place like that.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerAnswerNo",
      "en_US": [
        "No? That doesn’t make any sense.\n",
        "You have to come from somewhere.\r",
        "Oh! Wait! You’re not going to say you\n",
        "were born at the bottom of the sea?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName1",
      "en_US": [
        "First up, the Wood Gecko Pokémon.\n",
        "It’s TREECKO!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived1",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a TREECKO!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname1",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this TREECKO?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName2",
      "en_US": [
        "Next, we have the Chick Pokémon.\n",
        "It’s TORCHIC!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived2",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a TORCHIC!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname2",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this TORCHIC?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName3",
      "en_US": [
        "Last, we have the Mud Fish Pokémon.\n",
        "It’s MUDKIP!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived3",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a MUDKIP!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname3",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this MUDKIP?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "I can’t give you your amazing prizes\n",
        "unless your party has room for\r",
        "all three of them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion1",
      "en_US": [
        "The first question!\r",
        "Is there a place in the Hoenn region\n",
        "known as Fallarbor Town?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion2",
      "en_US": [
        "Well done!\n",
        "Now for the second question!\r",
        "Is it true that there are reporters\n",
        "in Hoenn known as Tabby and Gai?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion3",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow!\n",
        "Time for the third question!\r",
        "Is Lisia, the Contest Spectactular idol,\n",
        "also the sister of Gym Leader Wallace?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion4",
      "en_US": [
        "Incredible!\n",
        "It’s the fourth question!\r",
        "Tell me, Trainer...\n",
        "Where do you come from?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion5",
      "en_US": [
        "Fascinating!\n",
        "Now, for the last question!\r",
        "Can you beat me in a battle?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
